  "ABCD": "Aziz ABCD pattern: morning push A-B, higher-low C above VWAP, break of B",
  "EMA9_VWAP_CROSS": "SMB 'fashionably late': 9-EMA crosses above VWAP on 5-min bars, 10:00-13:00",
